x multiplication?" :question/worked-solution "We need to find a matrix $E$ such that $EA$ is equivalent to applying the elementary row operation ${R}_{1}↔{R}_{3}$ to $A.$\n\nTo find $E,$ we apply the given row operation to the identity matrix as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & ↔{R}_{3} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =E\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the equivalent notation in terms of matrix multiplication is $EA:$\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]\\cdot A\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-32146/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "09d8ec89-4d75-51ac-a870-1d2f8a1800ba"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-32146"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-42510/selection/fb084f46d12e4516cd89e145aacbeed65caf64e53fd87ec258d9d5078f88884e" :answer/id #uuid "77dbcd06-ce2d-5f91-916e-cf58f56750a4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "A\\cdot [\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42510/selection/343d6188265459277175569f9ee601335614b6db99c3df158656e4f087734538" :answer/id #uuid "3c0c3f84-30b2-51f6-b9e9-92ed640f79f2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot A" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42510/selection/1f2b0e3b6b46513bab674c6c262b21c5e16eb9e15630f7b0d924a08c62383800" :answer/id #uuid "8be72cbc-8d28-549c-ac67-2195fb6df9f2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\\cdot A" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-42510/selection/dfbbe31e82c7d889725d40c8c56227175704d2231b4658ef03b525e722777964" :answer/id #uuid "5f379e2b-95c3-517a-9e62-cd